WEBVTT

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:04.910 line:95%,end
Hi, I'm Harri Tanner, the CEO of Aspicore.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:12.150 line:95%,end
At Aspicore, we serve foundations and other grantmakers with our tailor-made

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.090 line:95%,end
grant management system.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:19.200 line:95%,end
Many of our customers who come to us are still handling things very manually –

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.500 line:95%,end
in Excel, in emails.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.840 line:95%,end
The communication with applicants sometimes gets lost,

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.670 line:95%,end
and they are not really following the best practices in the industry.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:39.720 line:95%,end
My father co-founded the company 35 years ago,

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:47.160 line:95%,end
and since then he served as the CEO until last December,

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:52.420 line:95%,end
when he retired. A couple of years earlier, we started to think about the

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:59.330 line:95%,end
succession planning, and it became quite obvious that the company would be sold.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:05.600 line:95%,end
We were talking with several potential buyers,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:13.260 line:95%,end
and with PubliX we got a good feeling that they will also help us in the succession.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:21.720 line:95%,end
Myself being quite a bit younger, and not having worked as a CEO before,

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:28.320 line:95%,end
they really helped me with support in this –

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:32.020 line:95%,end
a bit broader shoulders than myself –

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:37.840 line:95%,end
helping in both day-to-day operations and more strategic topics.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.650 line:95%,end
During the 35 years, obviously a lot has been done,

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:48.210 line:95%,end
and our products are getting on the older side.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:53.950 line:95%,end
So there's technical debt that we figured out together with the PubliX

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.850 line:95%,end
people that we need to address.

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:02.943 line:95%,end
PubliX is bringing in a CTO –

00:02:02.943 --> 00:02:05.590 line:95%,end
someone we couldn't hire ourselves –

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:13.450 line:95%,end
a lot of knowledge, a lot of new ideas, utilising AI in helping us refactor

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:18.910 line:95%,end
the code and build new features faster.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:24.470 line:95%,end
And this is something that will set us up to grow faster,

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:31.710 line:95%,end
get new customers onboarded, and set us up for a great future.
